WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.106 --> 00:00:02.137
- So, who you texting
tonight on the red carpet?

00:00:02.137 --> 00:00:03.133
- Me?

00:00:03.133 --> 00:00:04.169
- Yeah, who you texting?

00:00:04.169 --> 00:00:05.429
There's a phone out, right there.

00:00:05.429 --> 00:00:06.628
You hiding it back immediately?

00:00:06.628 --> 00:00:07.847
- Oh, no, no, no, no.

00:00:07.847 --> 00:00:08.781
I was playing Words with Friends.

00:00:08.781 --> 00:00:10.142
- Oh, who are you playing with?

00:00:10.142 --> 00:00:11.544
- No, no, no, no, no.

00:00:11.544 --> 00:00:12.662
I was playing solitaire.

00:00:12.662 --> 00:00:17.662
Who Do Celebs Text On the Red Carpet?

00:00:17.741 --> 00:00:18.736
- Who you texting?

00:00:18.736 --> 00:00:19.793
- Right now?

00:00:19.793 --> 00:00:20.809
- Yeah, who you texting?

00:00:20.809 --> 00:00:22.861
- Oh, I mean my phone's over
there but I did just text

00:00:22.861 --> 00:00:24.202
Taylor Swift and Jaime King.

00:00:24.202 --> 00:00:26.863
We have like a group text
and I sent them all these

00:00:26.863 --> 00:00:28.448
like selfies from all angles.

00:00:28.448 --> 00:00:30.784
I was like... this is
what's happening right now.

00:00:30.784 --> 00:00:31.719
- Have they responded?

00:00:31.719 --> 00:00:34.491
- They did respond, they
said very sweet things.

00:00:36.215 --> 00:00:37.713
- I can't imagine Taylor
Swift is that sweet

00:00:37.713 --> 00:00:38.911
but you know, I believe you.

00:00:38.911 --> 00:00:39.886
(Lorde laughing)

00:00:39.886 --> 00:00:42.483
- Have you been texting anybody
on this red carpet today?

00:00:42.483 --> 00:00:45.977
- Ah, just my dear
friend Robert Downey Jr.

00:00:45.977 --> 00:00:49.797
and my close, personal
pal Steven Spielberg.

00:00:49.797 --> 00:00:52.235
- Oh, I sent an audio
message saying, "I can't wait

00:00:52.235 --> 00:00:54.429
"to see you, girls, I can't
wait to see you, girls!"

00:00:54.429 --> 00:00:57.598
Okay, I texted Laura, she
didn't get back to me.

00:00:57.598 --> 00:00:58.675
(laughing)

00:00:58.675 --> 00:01:00.199
- Laura Prepon does not respond.

00:01:00.199 --> 00:01:01.621
- Girl, my phone's not working.

00:01:01.621 --> 00:01:02.759
- What happened?

00:01:02.759 --> 00:01:04.608
- There's so many people
here, my signal's jammed.

00:01:04.608 --> 00:01:06.558
- What are some of the
texts you've been sending

00:01:06.558 --> 00:01:08.303
to these bigwigs?

00:01:09.472 --> 00:01:12.072
- Which bitches do you have your eye on?

00:01:12.456 --> 00:01:13.852
- Who gonna hit it first?

00:01:13.852 --> 00:01:16.504
- I'd probably be just
texting like her something.

00:01:16.504 --> 00:01:17.540
- Something cute.

00:01:17.540 --> 00:01:18.393
- Like where are you?

00:01:18.393 --> 00:01:19.572
- Are you here?

00:01:19.572 --> 00:01:20.222
Are you nearby?

00:01:20.222 --> 00:01:22.172
The security made me move
down to the end of the carpet.

00:01:22.172 --> 00:01:23.127
I can't escape!

00:01:23.127 --> 00:01:24.346
I'm in the way!

00:01:24.346 --> 00:01:25.646
Background, background!

00:01:25.646 --> 00:01:26.764
- Background, move

00:01:26.764 --> 00:01:27.576
(laughing)

00:01:27.576 --> 00:01:30.307
- And has anyone seen my insoles?

00:01:31.030 --> 00:01:32.453
- Oh, you're missing your insoles.

00:01:32.453 --> 00:01:33.367
- They got away.

00:01:33.367 --> 00:01:34.565
- Those are my insoles.

00:01:34.565 --> 00:01:36.739
Spielberg is all mad bitches all day.

00:01:36.739 --> 00:01:37.970
He's nuts.

00:01:38.708 --> 00:01:39.587
- Alright.

00:01:45.016 --> 00:01:46.324
- Hey, thanks for stopping by with us.

00:01:46.324 --> 00:01:46.974
- Yeah, thanks.

00:01:46.974 --> 00:01:49.209
- If you do feel like texting anybody,

00:01:49.209 --> 00:01:51.261
she would happily take your number.

00:01:51.261 --> 00:01:52.460
- Yeah, I'll take your number.

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:52.924
- You know?

00:01:52.924 --> 00:01:54.593
- You'll have to run that by my fiancée.

00:01:54.593 --> 00:01:55.772
- Oh, okay.

00:01:55.772 --> 00:01:57.052
- What about if I took his number?

00:01:57.052 --> 00:01:58.758
I'm way less threatening.

00:01:58.758 --> 00:01:59.861
- This is just bad publicity over here.

